# The eye on a card its opponent was shown. Seat 0 (alice) holds Thoughtseize and one untapped
# Swamp, an uncontested turn-1 Main Phase 1. Seat 1 (bob) holds Timetwister, Lightning Bolt and a
# Mountain: alice takes the Lightning Bolt and bob's Timetwister and Mountain stay known to her. On
# his turn bob draws a Shock nobody was shown, then casts Timetwister off his three Islands: his hand
# goes back into his library and is shuffled, and alice knows none of it any more. Shock is in no
# other zone, so a Shock name reaching alice is a leak.
